# The context/ stubs and people/EXAMPLE.md ship as templates (placeholders only).
# Your real people files and component outputs stay local by default.

# Real people files (the EXAMPLE template is tracked)
people/*.md
!people/EXAMPLE.md

# Component working outputs (your generated files, not the shipped commands)
**/today.md
!**/.claude/commands/today.md
**/daily/
**/transcripts/
**/briefs/
**/standup/
**/inbox/

# OS / editor cruft
.DS_Store
.obsidian/
*.tmp
